### What exists now

- [`model.py`](/Users/river/scryglass/lol_kills/v2/draft/interactions/model.py) is synthetic-development machinery:
  - fits binary `label` rows without a predictive-target authority gate;
  - uses dense design/Hessian operations unsuitable for tens of thousands of OE edge terms;
  - “FM” rank is fixed at 4;
  - `_latent_profile` is a deterministic hash of ontology-bucket tokens, not a learned interaction representation;
  - development folds leave out `source_id`, not chronological or champion blocks.

- [`structured_prior.py`](/Users/river/scryglass/lol_kills/v2/draft/interactions/structured_prior.py):
  - hard-pins ontology rank 2;
  - rejects other ranks;
